[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3820162188","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105615#issuecomment-3820162188","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105615","id":3820162188,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jswyM","user":{"login":"paulocoutinhox","id":395096,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NTA5Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/395096?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox","html_url":"https://github.com/paulocoutinhox","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-29T20:33:05Z","updated_at":"2026-01-29T20:34:18Z","body":"I have the same problem.\n\n```\n  ERROR: core/extension/gdextension_library_loader.cpp:360 - No GDExtension library found for current OS and architecture (macos.arm64) in configuration file: res://addons/godotx_revenue_cat/godotx_revenue_cat.gdextension\n  ERROR: GDExtension dynamic library not found: 'res://addons/godotx_revenue_cat/godotx_revenue_cat.gdextension'.\n```\n\nIt need ignore when don't have library for current os.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3820162188/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3867242853","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105615#issuecomment-3867242853","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105615","id":3867242853,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7mgXFl","user":{"login":"DiplomaticRobot","id":40128966,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTI4OTY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40128966?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot","html_url":"https://github.com/DiplomaticRobot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-08T14:04:39Z","updated_at":"2026-02-23T23:07:19Z","body":"same here, i've done a swiftGodot ios plugin from https://github.com/migueldeicaza/SwiftGodot and now i get this while coding in macOS or windows. \n\nTried by adding dummy files to load those, no success, as then i get a OS error saying the .dll is not real and blocks the editor 😅\n\nThe actual error is in here:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/56f3e2611daadb0b1894b46737ee3000e82e33f9/core/extension/gdextension_library_loader.cpp#L362\n\nCurrently, when find_extension_library() returns empty, it unconditionally errors — even when the current OS was never mentioned in the .gdextension file at all. A platform-specific extension (iOS-only, Android-only, etc.) shouldn't be an error on other platforms.\n\nEDIT: Plugin is already published here as part of a MRP. https://github.com/SomniGameStudios/godot-firebase-ios","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3867242853/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4020070490","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105615#issuecomment-4020070490","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105615","id":4020070490,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vnWha","user":{"login":"DiplomaticRobot","id":40128966,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTI4OTY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40128966?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot","html_url":"https://github.com/DiplomaticRobot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-08T21:39:14Z","updated_at":"2026-03-08T21:41:59Z","body":"**Follow-up to my previous comment:** we've now implemented a working workaround for this in our [godot-firebase-ios](https://github.com/SomniGameStudios/godot-firebase-ios) plugin — sharing it here in case it's useful as a reference for others hitting the same problem.\n\n**Two-part solution:**\n\n- **[PR #1](https://github.com/SomniGameStudios/godot-firebase-ios/pull/1)** — Provide proper stub libraries for each non-iOS platform (macOS, Linux, Windows). The `.gdextension` file lists all platforms; non-iOS entries point to a stub that exports the required symbols but does nothing. This lets the editor load the extension silently on dev machines.\n- **[PR #2](https://github.com/SomniGameStudios/godot-firebase-ios/pull/3)** — On Windows specifically, an empty placeholder DLL caused `Error 193: not a valid Win32 application`. Fix was to compile a proper DLL from a minimal `stub.c` using MSVC (a `compile_stub_win.bat` helper is included).\n\nThis is a workaround at the plugin level — the real fix would be Godot ignoring missing platform entries for platforms not listed in the `.gdextension` file, which is the core issue described here. Leaving this here in case it helps anyone until that lands upstream.\n\ncc @gumaciel ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4020070490/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":4,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4089181894","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105615#issuecomment-4089181894","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105615","id":4089181894,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7zu_bG","user":{"login":"klicktock","id":601528,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTUyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601528?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/klicktock","html_url":"https://github.com/klicktock","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klicktock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klicktock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klicktock/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klicktock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klicktock/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klicktock/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klicktock/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klicktock/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klicktock/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-19T10:33:48Z","updated_at":"2026-03-19T10:33:48Z","body":"I agree this is a real impediment to writing platform specific libraries. I have iCloud KVS support GDExtension which works across MacOS and iOS I'd love to share, but it's so fragile. Open it up in Godot Windows and I get the same Error message explosion that you're seeing. \nThe optimum way to do this would be to build stubs for every platform and then compile on every platform with CI. But ... why? \nI also had a good attempt using EditorExportPlug to ensure that it's only deployed on iOS - but the editor still complains LOUDLY when opened on Windows. Frustrated.\nGDExtensions should be able to be filtered based on platform at the engine level. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4089181894/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4189080677","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105615#issuecomment-4189080677","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105615","id":4189080677,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75sExl","user":{"login":"Landeplage","id":1711394,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTEzOTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1711394?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Landeplage","html_url":"https://github.com/Landeplage","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Landeplage/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Landeplage/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Landeplage/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Landeplage/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Landeplage/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Landeplage/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Landeplage/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Landeplage/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Landeplage/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-05T15:43:58Z","updated_at":"2026-04-05T15:43:58Z","body":"Having the same issue in Godot 4.6, Windows 11. Editor is more or less unusable without a stub DLL.\n\nThe issue is also being discussed in [this IAP-plugin repo](https://github.com/hyochan/godot-iap/issues/23).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4189080677/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4191302977","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105615#issuecomment-4191302977","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105615","id":4191302977,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc750jVB","user":{"login":"klicktock","id":601528,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTUyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601528?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/klicktock","html_url":"https://github.com/klicktock","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klicktock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klicktock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klicktock/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klicktock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klicktock/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klicktock/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klicktock/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klicktock/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klicktock/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-06T09:07:23Z","updated_at":"2026-04-06T09:07:23Z","body":"I found a particularly ridiculous solution to some of this while working on my Steam achievements extension.\nI have regularly been using an export editor plugin to remove .gd files that I don't want exported, but I found I this didn't work when removing .dll/.so files.  (My Steam MacOS build needs steam.dll, but the itch.io Mac build does not.)\nI found that EditorExportPlugin->_get_name can be manipulated to modify the *alphabetical* order the files are processed. This was the secret to getting this all to work.\n\n```\nclass SteamExportPlugin extends EditorExportPlugin:\n\tfunc _get_name() -> String:\n\t\t# Godot sorts export plugins by this string and runs _export_file in that order.\n\t\t# The built-in \"GDExtension\" plugin must run *after* when we skip().\n\t\t# It calls add_shared_object() for libs/dependencies. If it runs first, DLLs are already queued.\n\t\t# Adding 000 prefix will ensure it sorts before \"GDExtension\" so we skip the .gdextension first.\n\t\treturn \"000 Steam Achievements\"\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4191302977/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5749669528","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105615#issuecomment-5749669528","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105615","id":5749669528,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVrT-mA","user":{"login":"gumaciel","id":20030153,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDMwMTUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20030153?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel","html_url":"https://github.com/gumaciel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-20T12:02:29Z","updated_at":"2026-09-20T12:02:29Z","body":"@hyochan @Repiteo  I think this can be closed; it's implemented in Godot 4.8: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121575","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5749669528/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5754257837","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105615#issuecomment-5754257837","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105615","id":5754257837,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVvsBrQ","user":{"login":"hyochan","id":27461460,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDYxNDYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27461460?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyochan","html_url":"https://github.com/hyochan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyochan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyochan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyochan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyochan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyochan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyochan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyochan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyochan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyochan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-21T01:31:25Z","updated_at":"2026-09-21T01:31:25Z","body":"Fine to close from the godot-iap side.\n\nOur shipped `.gdextension` has carried `include_tags` since [godot-iap 3.3.3](https://github.com/hyodotdev/openiap/releases/tag/godot-iap-3.3.3) ([hyodotdev/openiap#367](https://github.com/hyodotdev/openiap/pull/367)), and #121575 does what this issue asked for — the loader returns `ERR_SKIP` instead of erroring on a platform the extension was never built for.\n\nOne caveat for anyone landing here later: #121575 first shipped in `4.8-dev4` and was not backported to 4.7.x, so on 4.3 through 4.7 the messages still cannot be suppressed. Until 4.8 is stable, a platform-specific extension still needs a workaround — [ours is documented here](https://www.openiap.dev/docs/setup/godot#gdextension-non-apple-editor).\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5754257837/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]